NAME
    calc - graphical calculator

SYNOPSIS
    calc

DESCRIPTION
    A graphical keypad calculator for the VNU desktop. Arithmetic
    follows immediate execution without operator precedence, so
    2 + 3 * 4 is 20, not 14.

KEYS
    digits 0-9, . + - * / % and = operators, Backspace to clear
    the last digit, Esc closes the window. Launched from the
    desktop or as /apps/calc/bin; not reachable from the shell.
